.vscode/**
src/**
media/claude-code-provider-switcher-logo.png
node_modules/**
esbuild.mjs
tsconfig.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
pnpm-workspace.yaml
.gitignore

# Nothing below is needed at runtime, and some of it describes the development
# machine rather than the extension. vsce does NOT honour .gitignore, so a file
# ignored by git still ships unless it is named here — gitignored caches can
# carry absolute paths, and a packager once shipped one; the artifact gate
# exists for exactly that class. Verify with `npx @vscode/vsce ls` before
# every publish.
.etymd/**
.githooks/**
.github/**
.markdownlint.jsonc
AGENTS.md
DECISIONS.md
# Changesets config, the peirad manifest, and the vision probe drive repo-side
# dev checks (`changeset`, `doctor`, version-change probing) — installed
# extensions never read them. artifact-check.sh ships (vscode:prepublish runs it).
.changeset/**
peirad.json
scripts/vision-probe.sh
# The README links the roadmap by absolute GitHub URL (D-013), so the canonical copy is
# always one click away and a shipped duplicate would only go stale inside installed
# versions — a roadmap frozen at install time is worse than no roadmap.
ROADMAP.md
*.vsix

# Belt and braces: `vscode:prepublish` builds without a source map, so this should
# never match. If a stray map is ever present it must not ship — it is bigger than
# the bundle it describes and embeds the full TypeScript source.
**/*.map

# SVG sources for the icon and banner — the rendered PNGs ship, the sources do not.
media/*.svg
media/claude-code-provider-switcher-logo.png
